    {
      "x": 16,
      "z": 3,
      "kind": "sign",
      "text": "North: Anvilstead, the town on the terraces. South, down the switchbacks: the Undermine, and through it the Emberstep Quarry.",
      "text_fr": "Au nord : Bourg-l'Enclume, le bourg en terrasses. Au sud, en bas des lacets : les Galeries Basses, et au-delà la Carrière de Pas-de-Braise."
    },
    {
      "kind": "find",
      "id": "sn_scree",
      "x": 25,
      "z": 3,
      "give": "coins:60",
      "text": "At the top of the scree, wedged under a slab where the wind can't get it: a climber's purse, heavy with Facets.",
      "text_fr": "En haut des éboulis, coincée sous une dalle à l'abri du vent : la bourse d'un grimpeur, lourde de Facettes."
