          "Deux cartes Récompense."
        ],
        "win": [
          "Well stacked. You'd make a cairn builder."
        ],
        "win_fr": [
          "Bien empilé. Tu ferais un bâtisseur de cairns."
        ],
        "lose": [
          "Steady base, patient top. That's a cairn, and that's a deck."
        ],
        "lose_fr": [
          "Une base solide, un sommet patient. C'est ça, un cairn, et c'est ça, un deck."
        ],
        "after": [
          "Six cairns on this pass. I built the first one forty years ago. Add a stone to each. Something happens. I won't say what."
        ],
        "after_fr": [
          "Six cairns sur ce col. J'ai bâti le premier il y a quarante ans. Ajoute une pierre à chacun. Il se passe quelque chose. Je ne dirai pas quoi."
        ]
      },
      "outfit": "#6a7a5a",
      "hair": "#e0e0d8"
    },
    {
      "id": "nessa",
      "name": "Nessa",
