      "hair": "#3a2a1a",
      "if": "!time:night",
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "lines": [
            "Mind the sheep. They know the pass better than you; they'll stand where they like.",
            "The miners who dug the Undermine came up this way every evening. My grandmother sold them soup at the top. Now there's only me and the sheep, and you."
          ],
          "lines_fr": [
            "Attention aux moutons. Ils connaissent le col mieux que toi ; ils se mettent où ils veulent.",
            "Les mineurs qui ont creusé les Galeries montaient par ici chaque soir. Ma grand-mère leur vendait de la soupe en haut. Maintenant, il n'y a plus que moi, les moutons, et toi."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
