        {
          "lines": [
            "Pull up a stone. The fire's the only warm thing on this pass after dark.",
            "Prospecting by night? No. Star-watching. The Stonebacks are close to the sky.",
            "Seren, up in Anvilstead, worked the Undermine before the fall. Ask her about the side passages. She knows what's behind every one."
          ],
          "lines_fr": [
            "Prends une pierre. Le feu, c'est la seule chose chaude du col après la nuit tombée.",
            "Prospecter la nuit ? Non. Regarder les étoiles. Les Échines sont près du ciel.",
